# 52. What NOT To Do

DO NOT:

```
poll Docker logs every 100ms
```

DO NOT:

```
create a new process for every console command
```

DO NOT:

```
create one Docker log reader per browser
```

DO NOT:

```
store unlimited console output in RAM
```

DO NOT:

```
allow a slow browser to block Minecraft
```

DO NOT:

```
kill Minecraft when Panel WebSocket disconnects
```

DO NOT:

```
trust browser-provided resource limits
```

DO NOT:

```
expose arbitrary shell execution publicly
```

DO NOT:

```
mix Agent logs with Minecraft logs
```

DO NOT:

```
create goroutines without cancellation
```

DO NOT:

```
use blocking WebSocket writes in critical process-output paths
```

DO NOT:

```
send thousands of stats updates per second
```

