# 54. The Most Important Design Principle

Treat the Agent as an **event-driven node operating system for game servers**.

It should not behave like:

```
HTTP request
   ->
execute something
   ->
HTTP response
   ->
forget everything
```

Instead:

```
long-lived Agent
      |
      +---- server runtime
      |
      +---- event streams
      |
      +---- process streams
      |
      +---- WebSocket
      |
      +---- state machine
      |
      +---- resource monitoring
      |
      +---- recovery
```

The Agent should know what is actually happening on the node.

The Panel should display and control that state.

