The fundamental philosophy is:

```
PROCESS OUTPUT = STREAM

USER COMMANDS = STREAM

SERVER EVENTS = EVENTS

SERVER STATE = STATE MACHINE

RESOURCE METRICS = SAMPLED DATA

PANEL ↔ AGENT = LONG-LIVED AUTHENTICATED CONNECTION

AGENT ↔ GAME SERVER = DIRECT RUNTIME CONTROL

BROWSER ↔ PANEL = REAL-TIME WEBSOCKET
```

Build the Agent around these principles rather than around individual HTTP endpoints.

